  "notes": [
    "Action: Load this scenario via getTestScenario and inject it via injectGameState.",
    "Expect: Start in MAIN_PHASE with playerId_1 turn, currentBattle null, processingQueue empty, and playerId_2 shield[0] is ST08-010.",
    "Action: Player 1 attacks playerId_2 shield area with slot4 ST08-003_attacker_p1_0004 and resolve confirmBattle for both players until burst choice appears.",
    "Expect: BURST_EFFECT_CHOICE appears for playerId_2 on ST08-010.",
    "Action: Player 2 confirms burst choice with confirmed=true.",
    "Expect: ST08-010 moves from playerId_2 shield area to playerId_2 hand.",
    "Action: End playerId_1 turn. On playerId_2 MAIN_PHASE, play ST08-010 from hand as pilot onto playerId_2 slot1 ST08-003_host_mafty_p2_0001.",
    "Expect: PAIRING_COMPLETE resolves because the paired unit is a (Mafty) Unit, and TARGET_CHOICE appears for playerId_2's (Mafty) Units only: slot1 ST08-003_host_mafty_p2_0001 and slot2 ST08-005_other_mafty_p2_0002. Non-(Mafty) slot3 ST01-001_non_mafty_p2_0003 is not selectable.",
    "Action: Resolve TARGET_CHOICE by selecting playerId_2 slot2 ST08-005_other_mafty_p2_0002.",
    "Expect: Only the selected slot2 unit gains temporary allow_attack_target permission until end of turn, slot1 host does not gain that permission unless selected, and exactly 1 of playerId_2's 4 energy becomes rested from paying ST08-010's cost.",
    "Action: Enter ATTACK_PHASE and declare an attack with playerId_2 slot2 ST08-005_other_mafty_p2_0002.",
    "Expect: Attack target candidates include playerId_1 slot1 ST08-005_enemy_damaged_active_0001 and slot3 ST01-001_enemy_damaged_active_0003 because they are damaged and active, while slot2 ST01-009_enemy_undamaged_active_0002 is not selectable by the granted active-target permission.",
    "Action: Choose playerId_1 slot1 ST08-005_enemy_damaged_active_0001 as the attack target and resolve confirmBattle.",
    "Expect: Battle proceeds against the damaged active enemy unit, confirming the selected (Mafty) Unit may choose a damaged active enemy Unit as its attack target during this turn."
  ],
